managedappsd(8)             System Manager's Manual            managedappsd(8)

NAME
     managedappsd – Managed apps daemon

SYNOPSIS
     managedappsd

DESCRIPTION
     managedappsd handles requests from managed apps for administrator-
     provisioned configuration and secrets.

FILES
     /System/Library/LaunchDaemons/com.apple.managedappsd.plist

DIAGNOSTICS
     Logging can be viewed via: log stream -—predicate 'senderImagePath
     contains "managedappsd"'

